WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.208
Aceitar a sugestão da IA no card

2
00:00:02.208 --> 00:00:05.601
Abra CRM no menu lateral

3
00:00:05.601 --> 00:00:08.767
Clique em Kanban

4
00:00:08.767 --> 00:00:10.271
Escolha o Funil Comercial

5
00:00:10.272 --> 00:00:14.144
Abra o card com sugestão

6
00:00:14.144 --> 00:00:16.118
Veja o selo de estágio sugerido

7
00:00:16.118 --> 00:00:22.438
Clique em Aceitar

8
00:00:22.438 --> 00:00:25.591
Feche o card

9
00:00:25.591 --> 00:00:27.219
Abra o Calendário do CRM

10
00:00:27.219 --> 00:00:30.385
Ligue o Lembrete de retorno

11
00:00:30.385 --> 00:00:32.593
Pronto
